            "text_3cbTNY": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>The story goes back decades ago to a small village in Armenia, where our ancestors successfully grew grapes. We had the privilege to grow up watching our family leader work hard to support and raise her family, who to your surprise is none other than our grandma Rosa. Grandma Rosa initially began working at a cognac factory in the late 60’s, however due to her passion and commitment for her work, she eventually became the owner of the cognac factory. Her never ending positivity and service to her family, along with her dedication to her vineyard has heavily influenced our decision to continue her legacy. All the decisions we made in our winemaking business were intended to make her proud.<br/><br/></p>",
